    <div class="container">
      <div class="testimonial__header reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Reviews</p>
        <h2 class="testimonial__heading">What Our Customers<br /><span>Are Saying</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial__cards">
        <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=hesson+plumbing#lrd=0x88389b12c5cf667d:0xcd87c4b9a7a7ad52,3" target="_blank" class="testimonial__card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="testimonial__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <blockquote>"He did such a great job I am having him out to do another job for us in the upcoming weeks. Courteous service, thorough inspection, and very reasonable pricing."</blockquote>
          <p class="testimonial__name">Justin Richards</p>
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=hesson+plumbing#lrd=0x88389b12c5cf667d:0xcd87c4b9a7a7ad52,3" target="_blank" class="testimonial__card reveal delay-2">
          <div class="testimonial__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <blockquote>"Dave made replacing my broken garbage disposal easy. Arrived on time, fast work, was courteous and very professional. Fairly priced too. Thank you for your excellent service!"</blockquote>
          <p class="testimonial__name">Trish</p>
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=hesson+plumbing#lrd=0x88389b12c5cf667d:0xcd87c4b9a7a7ad52,3" target="_blank" class="testimonial__card reveal delay-3">
          <div class="testimonial__stars">★★★★★</div>
          <blockquote>"Had a pipe burst behind drywall on first floor. Dave was able to determine the location of the leak with minimal impact to drywall. We appreciated their timely communication and that they were able to come out the same day."</blockquote>
          <p class="testimonial__name">Stacy S.</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial__footer reveal">
